 just had an operation.","start":26.39,"end":28.43,"score":0.993,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-077-004","sourceId":"b2-077-004","sourceIndex":3,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,16],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The mummy is that of Shepenmut who was once a singer in the Temple of Thebes.","start":30.22,"end":37.69,"score":0.966,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-077-005-p01","sourceId":"b2-077-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":1,"parts":2,"wordRange":[0,13],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"As there were strange marks on the X-ray plates taken of the mummy,","start":39.323,"end":44.023,"score":0.972,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-077-005-p02","sourceId":"b2-077-005","sourceIndex":4,"part":2,"parts":2,"wordRange":[13,28],"wordModel":"english-ctc-fallback","text":"doctors have been trying to find out whether the woman died of a rare disease.","start":44.56,"end":49.29,"score":0.941,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-077-006","sourceId":"b2-077-006","sourceIndex":5,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,9],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The only way to do this was to operate.","start":50.463,"end":53.17,"score":0.991,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-077-007","sourceId":"b2-077-007","sourceIndex":6,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,22],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The operation, which lasted for over four hours, proved to be very difficult because of the hard resin which covered the skin.","start":54.02,"end":63.12,"score":0.967,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-077-008","sourceId":"b2-077-008","sourceIndex":7,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,14],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The doctors removed a section of the mummy and sent it to a laboratory.","start":64.26,"end":68.51,"score":0.976,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-077-009","sourceId":"b2-077-009","sourceIndex":8,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,19],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"They also found something which the X-ray plates did not show: a small wax figure of the god Duamutef.","start":69.96,"end":79.47,"score":0.959,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-077-010","sourceId":"b2-077-010","sourceIndex":9,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,15],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"This god which has the head of a cow was normally placed inside a mummy.","start":80.84,"end":86.89,"score":0.9,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"reviewReasons":["low-word-confidence"]},{"id":"b2-077-011","sourceId":"b2-077-011","sourceIndex":10,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,10],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"The doctors have not yet decided how the woman died.","start":87.58,"end":90.78,"score":0.982,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-077-012","sourceId":"b2-077-012","sourceIndex":11,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,20],"wordModel":"mms-fa","text":"They feared that the mummy would fall to pieces when they cut it open, but fortunately this has not happened.","start":91.62,"end":98.56,"score":0.975,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":false,"reviewReasons":[]},{"id":"b2-077-013","text":"The mummy successfully survived the operation.","start":99.752,"end":102.823,"score":0.917,"timingValid":true,"needsReview":true,"sourceId":"b2-077-013","sourceIndex":12,"part":1,"parts":1,"wordRange":[0,6],"wordModel":"legacy-review","reviewReasons":["unresolved-word-alignment"]}]}
